# Determinism

- The same inputs produce byte-identical output. Sort collections. Do not put timestamps, durations, host names, or random ids in report content.
- A successful report depends on the SBOM bytes, the policy bytes, and the format flag. Do not canonicalize user paths into that report.
- Write report line endings as LF, including on Windows.
- Keep repository text on LF via `.gitattributes`, so golden files match on Windows and Linux.
